<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have seized a major town in eastern DRC, breaking a ceasefire and intensifying fighting with the Congolese army. ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri province while an ISIL affiliate sustains itself through conflict gold. A drone strike hit Bunyakiri hospital, forcing MSF to move 76 patients. A Chinese national was abducted and two people were killed in an ambush at Kalemie. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOTkhBTTZJWk96aEl6REtXTzhXWmJtekNMNjcxQlhtOE9tSW9CX1ljZEFON2ptYVVTZGs2SW9Xd1ZSc21uMUowa0FYY2tOTVcybnFwbWdTcUI5NXBUSG8wdXBoMGJuRlJBbHJZeC1UVTN3R0ZRWWtRREJoYXpsTHlXUENLY3o5R19LZnltczZqYWVMa2MwSUFSVzVaNXJMZjRkd1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;globalpost.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQVkwxeWgzclRSelIyeTA4UXg1ZTFXTW5nSTYwMkItN01wTDg0QlAwbUN6Xy1Cc0UyTjFmSk50bkNrZ0ZGWU5hb0N5NEctNDZPeEVmTldWSUFoSFZVYUlGaVZYTnFUdGJYZ0pTd1l4LW1OR1ZzTWJnbUp4dUJhbHNoZ0Z5Z1Zkd1RJVlRsYXpfVWJnajYwdEpzUkJSNUJUanZ1c2pQMXItajhWTGpXNHhYMzFpSnJXdUFERjE3X1ctSWo2NFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Infection Control Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5OSTFmSXJCWVVnSWRpUjlpZ3JQS2g0MXpKRi1MY3NmMTlkemlvdkpObGxQa1VRcmJJaFd3SmE1MUw0bl9HUHc3T0wzVEs0cEtuZzIxZFpGNmgyZHJONUhmS1RrOWdvM0FVTmFwMTdtT3VCQm1DeWpz?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQalNDTWJMNEp2WUNCLXdEUm9hWG0yY2F2b3VNLUVLY2xWLVVMYVl6SHhwcU91ZkUwSThMTUItcElRZEZMaVF2blFZcEc0NE40eUdRWFdyTHRNejE3OGxXQ2U1eFlj